id":"m_ex_ttstar_02_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"prika_i","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_ttstar_02_12","text":"???","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_ttstar_02_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"prika_i","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_ttstar_02_13","text":"That just makes it weirder.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_ttstar_02_14","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_ttstar_02_14","text":"It's basically emotional support.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_ttstar_02_15","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_ttstar_02_15","text":"We cheer each other on and stuff.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_ttstar_02_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"prika_i","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_ttstar_02_16","text":"Hmm...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_ttstar_02_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"prika_i","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_ttstar_02_17","text":"I'll take your word for it.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_ttstar_02_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"prika_i","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_ttstar_02_18","text":"But there's something I'm curious about.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_ttstar_02_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"prika_i","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_ttstar_02_19","text":"Why does Mint call you \"Kitten\"?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_ttstar_02_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"mint_i","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_ttstar_02_20","text":"It's kind of a long story, but...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_ttstar_02_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"mint_i","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_ttstar_02_21","text":"TL;DR:","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_ttstar_02_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"mint_i","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_ttstar_02_22","text":"I just like cats? <(ΦωΦ)/","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_ttstar_02_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"prika_i","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_ttstar_02_23","text":"Hm.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_ttstar_02_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"mint_i","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_ttstar_02_24","text":"Why?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_ttstar_02_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"mint_i","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_ttstar_02_25","text":"Does \"Muse\" suddenly sound too ordinary to you?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_ttstar_02_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"mint_i","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_ttstar_02_26","text":"Is it really that special just because I call him \"Kitten\"?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_ttstar_02_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"prika_i","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_ttstar_02_27","text":"It just feels kinda childish.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_ttstar_02_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"mint_i","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_ttstar_02_28","text":"Sounds like someone's jealous!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_ttstar_02_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"mint_i","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_ttstar_02_29","text":"\"Muse\" isn't exactly the most elegant nickname either.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_ttstar_02_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"prika_i","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_ttstar_02_30","text":"It's how I show my respect and admiration.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_ttstar_02_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"mint_i","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_ttstar_02_31","text":"It sounds kind of stiff and distant, if you ask me.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_ttstar_02_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"mint_i","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_ttstar_02_32","text":"Still,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_ttstar_02_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"mint_i","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_ttstar_02_33","text":"as long as Kitten likes it,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_ttstar_02_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"mint_i","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_ttstar_02_34","text":"that's all that matters, right?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_ttstar_02_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"prika_i","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_ttstar_02_35","text":"On that, we agree.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_ttstar_02_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"prika_i","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_ttstar_02_36","text":"Muse,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_ttstar_02_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"prika_i","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_ttstar_02_37","text":"do you like the nickname we gave you?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_ttstar_02_38","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_ttstar_02_38","text":"I really like it!","jump":"m_ex_ttstar_02_40"},{"id":"m_ex_ttstar_02_39","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_ttstar_02_39","text":"Honestly, it's a bit much.","jump":"m_ex_ttstar_02_46"},{"id":"m_ex_ttstar_02_40","type":"Speech","speaker":"mint_i","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_ttstar_02_40","text":"Then that's enough.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_ttstar_02_41","type":"Speech","speaker":"mint_i","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_ttstar_02_41","text":"Even if it seems a little childish or a little stiff.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_ttstar_02_42","type":"Speech","speaker":"prika_i","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_ttstar_02_42","text":"Fair enough.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_ttstar_02_43","type":"Speech","speaker":"prika_i","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_ttstar_02_43","text":"I'll keep calling you Muse, then.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_ttstar_02_44","type":"Speech","speaker":"mint_i","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_ttstar_02_44","text":"Kitten! /(ΦωΦ)/","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_ttstar_02_45","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_ttstar_02_45","text":"Hahaha, sure, sure.","jump":"m_ex_ttstar_02_55"},{"id":"m_ex_ttstar_02_46","type":"Speech","speaker":"mint_i","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_ttstar_02_46","text":"( ΦωΦ )!!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_ttstar_02_47","type":"Speech","speaker":"mint_i","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_ttstar_02_47","text":"Is it?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_ttstar_02_48","type":"Speech","speaker":"mint_i","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_ttstar_02_48","text":"I guess I can see why.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_ttstar_02_49","type":"Speech","speaker":"mint_i","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_ttstar_02_49","text":"After all, I'm the one calling you \"Kitten.\"","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_ttstar_02_50","type":"Speech","speaker":"prika_i","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_ttstar_02_50","text":"If it's too much, maybe I should call you something else.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_ttstar_02_51","type":"Speech","speaker":"prika_i","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_ttstar_02_51","text":"But honestly, I can't think of anything besides \"Muse.\"","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_ttstar_02_52","type":"Speech","speaker":"mint_i","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_ttstar_02_52","text":"Then there's no need to change it.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_ttstar_02_53","type":"Speech","speaker":"mint_i","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_ttstar_02_53","text":"You'll just have to get used to it, Kitten.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_ttstar_02_54","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_ttstar_02_54","text":"... Guess I'll have to.","jump":"m_ex_ttstar_02_55"},{"id":"m_ex_ttstar_02_55","type":"Speech","speaker":"prika_i","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_ttstar_02_55","text":"Welp,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_ttstar_02_56","type":"Speech","speaker":"prika_i","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_ttstar_02_56","text":"guess it's about time I head back to the salon.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_ttstar_02_57","type":"Speech","speaker":"prika_i","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_ttstar_02_57","text":"I'll text you later, Muse.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_ttstar_02_58","type":"Speech","speaker":"mint_i","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_ttstar_02_58","text":"~( ΦωΦ )~ Bye!","jump":null}],"chat":true}